{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52280","headline":"诗（幷序） 四十一 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 四十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虚沾一百年，八十最是老。\n长命得八十，不解学修道。\n悠悠度好日，无心念三宝。\n根（一作「报」，张改作「抱」，项校作「把」）拳入地狱，天堂无人到。\n圻（项校作「坼」）破五戒身，却入三恶道。\n一入恒沙劫，不须自懊恼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52280.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52280","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}